// Q-112 `private let q` beside `route GET /q ? { q: str } = q`: the field binds the key `q`, but the body reads the private variable, not what the request sent
// mode: serve
// get: /q?q=sent
// open-when: the variable
// fixed-when: sent
// From FEEDBACK16.md §Q-112 (found on b28e689).

private let q = "the variable"

route GET /q ? { q: str } = q
